unty"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, October to November and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years. On the middle, September to October and October to November both sat at 60% in 2025, and May to June hit 228% in 2026. Grid 13077 had its driest year in 1954 at 50%.</p>"}
